        <item>
            <title>0.1.6-beta</title>
            <pubDate>Wed, 30 Sep 2026 15:00:59 +0200</pubDate>
            <link>https://typoless.app</link>
            <sparkle:channel>beta</sparkle:channel>
            <sparkle:version>105</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.1.6-beta</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>26.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description><![CDATA[<h3>Updates</h3>
<ul>
    <li>The menu bar no longer offers a version that has been overtaken. Typoless looks for a new version once a day without asking for anything, and pressing the notice checks again, so you are always offered the newest one and never have to update twice to catch up.</li>
</ul>
<h3>Settings</h3>
<ul>
    <li>A note under a setting that is switched off is dimmed, so it no longer reads as though it still applies.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
